0.5.2 2026-11-19
    - Enable zero-configuration Docker setup for the export service when
      Kustvakt is reachable at http://kustvakt:8089. The container listens
      on all IPv4 interfaces by default (kupietz).
    - Set a different backend with KALAMAR_EXPORT_API_URL. Existing API
      settings remain supported (kupietz).
    - Place configured API path prefixes before /api/v1.0/search (kupietz).
    - Update Jetty to 12.1.15 and Logback Classic to 1.6.7 (dependabot).

0.5.1 2026-11-18
    - Upgrade the Docker runtime to Java 25 with pinned Corretto 25.0.5.1.2,
      fixing CVE-2026-114938 (Java4Shell) (kupietz).
    - Ship a compact linked runtime and run Maven tests on its module set
      (kupietz).
    - Use glibc for compatibility with older Docker hosts, including the
      CoRoLa CentOS 7 server, and preserve the export user's numeric IDs
      for existing mounted directories (kupietz).

0.5.0 2026-11-17
    - Release the built-in export integration tested with Kalamar 0.67,
      retaining the Authorization-header and export/config changes from
      0.5.0-beta.1 (kupietz).

0.5.0-beta.1 2026-11-15
    - Prefer the Authorization header, as set by Kalamar's proxy,
      over the session cookie (kupietz).
    - Provide the limits of the service as JSON (export/config)
      for the export form built into Kalamar (kupietz).

0.4.3 2026-11-12
    - Load export assets from the local frontend through Kalamar's proxy (kupietz).
    - Fix HTTP 400 on export when the search URL omits the query language (kupietz).
    - Updated dependencies (hebasta, kupietz).

0.4.2 2026-09-09
    - Updated dependencies (diewald)

0.4.1 2026-02-15
    - Removed no longer needed workaround for export of KWICs from licensed texts with Firefox (kupietz)

0.4.0 2026-02-14
    - Upgraded Docker Java to 25.
    - Upgraded target Java to 21.
    - Fix export of KWICs from licensed texts with Firefox and Safari (kupietz).
    - Added support for randomizing page order in export (resolves #182) (kupietz).

